    "print(f'\\\\n重复行: {df.duplicated().sum()}')\\n",
    "print(f'\\\\n结论: 数据完整，无缺失值和重复行 ✓')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. 探索性分析 (EDA)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "在进行假设检验之前，先从描述统计角度观察两组差异。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 3.1 核心指标描述统计\\n",
    "print('核心指标对比')\\n",
    "print('=' * 50)\\n",
    "\\n",
    "metrics = {\\n",
    "    '转化率': ('made_purchase', 'mean'),\\n",
    "    '点击率': ('clicked', 'mean'),\\n",
    "    '平均客单价': ('order_amount', lambda x: x[x > 0].mean()),\\n",
    "    '总 GMV': ('order_amount', 'sum'),\\n",
    "}\\n",
